    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1276">

                <pb facs="0879" n="763" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg763"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/9313.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General Hanna to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monterey</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 19, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Forced loan by the Federals is expected here. British Consul just now called and
                    we shall recommend foreigners refusing payment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
